error: cannot assign to `r` while a value read from it is still in use
  --> should_fail/assign-last-cycle-bad.anvil:12:13
   |
12 |             set r := 1'b1
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `r` is assigned here
  --> should_fail/assign-last-cycle-bad.anvil:8:21
   |
 8 |         send e.req (*r) >>
   |                     ^^ `r` is read here, and must stay unchanged until 1 cycle after the `send e.req` on line 8
   = note: reading `r` with `*` does not copy it, so `r` must not change until the value read is no longer needed
   = help: assign `r` after the last use of the value, or copy the value into another register first

